<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal inflation 0.2 pct mo/mo in Feb.</title>
<headline>Portugal inflation 0.2 pct mo/mo in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese consumer prices rose 0.2 percent month-on-month in February after 0.3 percent in January to give year-on-year inflation of 2.9 percent after 3.3 percent previously, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>Average annual inflation, the government's yardstick, was 3.2 percent in February unchanged on January.</p>
<p> PORTUGUESE INFLATION	  Feb 97	 Jan 97</p>
<p> Monthly CPI rise		  0.2	    0.3</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation		2.9	    3.3</p>
<p> Average annual inflation	3.2	    3.2</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	 132.9	  132.6</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
